---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — AIToolvise"
  description="AIToolvise privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your information."
>
  <section class="section container prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: August 2, 2026</em></p>

    <p>This policy explains what information AIToolvise collects, how it's used, and your choices around it. AIToolvise is a solo-run site — there's no data-sharing arrangement with a team or agency, and any data collected is handled directly by me, Muhammad Saad.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>AIToolvise does not currently run analytics or advertising tools, so we do not currently collect browsing analytics, cookies for tracking, or ad-related data. If that changes in the future — for example, if we add an analytics tool to understand site traffic, or run ads — this policy will be updated first, and the new section will name the specific tool and what it collects.</p>
    <p>The main information we do collect is what you choose to submit yourself, described below.</p>

    <h2>Contact Form Submissions</h2>
    <p>When you use the contact form on this site, we collect your name, email address, subject, and message. This information is submitted through <a href="https://web3forms.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Web3Forms</a>, a third-party form-processing service that relays your submission to our inbox by email. Web3Forms does not use your data for any purpose beyond delivering that message to us — see <a href="https://web3forms.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Web3Forms' own privacy policy</a> for details on how they handle data in transit.</p>
    <p>We use this information only to respond to your message. We don't add contact form submissions to any mailing list, and we don't sell or share this information with anyone else.</p>
    <p>If you email us directly at <a href="mailto:aitoolvise@gmail.com">aitoolvise@gmail.com</a>, the same principle applies — your email address and message are used only to respond to you.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We keep contact form submissions and emails for as long as needed to respond to your message and for a reasonable period afterward for reference. If you'd like us to delete a message or email you've previously sent us, contact us and we'll remove it.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site does not currently set cookies for tracking or advertising purposes. Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may use minimal technical cookies or data necessary to serve the site securely and reliably — this is standard for any hosted website and isn't used to track you across other sites. If we introduce analytics or advertising cookies in the future, this section will be updated to explain what's used and how to opt out.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>Our site contains links to third-party tools and services, including affiliate links (see our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details). Once you click through to another site, that site's own privacy policy applies — we're not responsible for how third parties collect or handle your data once you leave AIToolvise.</p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>AIToolvise is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 13. If you believe a child has submitted information to us, contact us and we'll remove it.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask us at any time what information we hold about you (limited to what you've submitted via the contact form or email), and you can ask us to correct or delete it. Just reach out through the contact page or by emailing us directly.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes — for example, when we add analytics or advertising — we'll update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We recommend checking back occasionally if you have ongoing privacy concerns.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>

    <nav class="related">
      <p>See also: <a href="/about/">About</a> · <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a> · <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a></p>
    </nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 720px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  .related { margin-top: var(--space-4); padding-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: var(--color-text-muted); }
</style>